  "prefLabel": "Csp 102.09 Committees of the Commission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 102.09 Committees of the Commission. The commission by resolution shall designate such committees, which shall have such authority as the resolution shall specify to the extent not inconsistent with law.\n\nSource. #7082, eff 8-26-99; ss by #9583, eff 11-2-09",
